@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 150
scale 1 as 70 pixels
concise "Operator" as OP
robust "Confirmation" as CS
robust "Sanitize engine" as EN
concise "Target medium" as MD

@0
OP is Reviewing
CS is new
EN is idle
MD is "original data"

@1
CS is shown

@3
OP is Typing
CS is confirmed_yes

@4
OP is Waiting
CS is authorized

@5
EN is resolving

@6
EN is writing
MD is "being overwritten"

@11
EN is verifying
MD is overwritten

@13
EN is certifying

@14
EN is idle
CS is used
OP is Reviewing
MD is "sanitized (PASS)"

@16
@enduml
